  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Battle in the Sewers\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Primary Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Emperor%27s_Hand\" title=\"Emperor&#39;s Hand\">Emperor's Hand</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Raisu_Pavilion\" title=\"Raisu Pavilion\">Raisu Pavilion</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Kaineng_City\" title=\"Kaineng City\">Kaineng City</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/City_Under_Attack\" title=\"City Under Attack\">City Under Attack</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Followed by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sunjiang_District\" title=\"Sunjiang District\">Sunjiang District</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">Primary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ACD;\">Map(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Battle in the Sewers - Path to Commander Jafai.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/45/Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg/250px-Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/45/Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg/375px-Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/45/Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg/500px-Battle_in_the_Sewers_-_Path_to_Commander_Jafai.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"668\" data-file-height=\"669\" /></a><br /><small>(Click to enlarge)</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"float: right; margin-left: 1em;\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Intermediate_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Escort reinforcements to the entrance of <a href=\"/wiki/Sunjiang_District_(outpost)\" title=\"Sunjiang District (outpost)\">Sunjiang District</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Meet the <a href=\"/wiki/Royal_Guard_(Factions)\" title=\"Royal Guard (Factions)\">Royal Guard</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shenzun_Tunnels\" title=\"Shenzun Tunnels\">Shenzun Tunnels</a>.</li>\n<li>Escort the Royal Guard to <a href=\"/wiki/Commander_Jafai\" title=\"Commander Jafai\">Commander Jafai</a>.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Royal_Guard_Kazuya\" title=\"Royal Guard Kazuya\">Royal Guard Kazuya</a> for your reward.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>3,000 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li>150 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Skill_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Point\">Skill Point</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After you've been given the quest, map travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Tahnnakai_Temple_(outpost)\" title=\"Tahnnakai Temple (outpost)\">Tahnnakai Temple</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Maatu_Keep\" title=\"Maatu Keep\">Maatu Keep</a>. You will find a group of 10 Royal Guards outside. Follow the directions and clear the <a href=\"/wiki/Mob\" title=\"Mob\">mobs</a> in your way. Make sure you keep at least one Guard alive while traveling to Commander Jafai. If you have succeeded, Commander Jafai will let you into the <a href=\"/wiki/Sunjiang_District_(outpost)\" title=\"Sunjiang District (outpost)\">Sunjiang District outpost</a>. Do not linger around since there will be more groups of <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a> approaching once you get near the commander.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Royal_Guard_(Factions)\" title=\"Royal Guard (Factions)\">Royal Guards</a> (10 of them)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Warrior\" title=\"Afflicted Warrior\">Afflicted Warrior</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Ranger\" title=\"Afflicted Ranger\">Afflicted Ranger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Monk\" title=\"Afflicted Monk\">Afflicted Monk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Necromancer\" title=\"Afflicted Necromancer\">Afflicted Necromancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Mesmer\" title=\"Afflicted Mesmer\">Afflicted Mesmer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Elementalist\" title=\"Afflicted Elementalist\">Afflicted Elementalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (26) <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Assassin\" title=\"Afflicted Assassin\">Afflicted Assassin</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Emperor's Hand</dt></dl>\n<p><i>The emperor tells me that you are heading to the Sunjiang District to fight Shiro. You are either very brave or very foolhardy. Commander Jafai is holding down the front lines there, but I do not think things are going in our favor. Escort these members of the emperor's <b>Royal Guard</b> to <b>Commander Jafai</b> to help reinforce his position.</i>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"Just doing my duty to the emperor.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"On second thought, it does sound foolhardy.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"I have sent word to Commander Jafai in the Sunjiang District to expect you and the Royal Guard. You should make haste, they really need the reinforcements.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate_dialogue\">Intermediate dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Commander Jafai</dt></dl>\n<p><i>You have no idea how relieved I am to see you. These reinforcements will help save many lives. Let me know when you are ready, and we will secure an area for you within.</i>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <b>Let's go.</b></dd>\n<dd><i>It is good you have come; we need all the help we can get! If you are ready we can push forward into the Sunjiang District.</i>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <b>I am ready.</b></dd>\n<dd><i>Your entire party is about to be moved to the next area. Make sure all party members are ready first. Do you wish to continue?</i>\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <b>Yes.</b> (sent to <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_in_the_Sewers_(cinematic)\" title=\"Battle in the Sewers (cinematic)\">Battle in the Sewers (cinematic)</a>)</dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <b>No.</b></dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>  <b>Not right now.</b></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Royal Guard Kazuya</dt></dl>\n<p><i>We have reinforced this area, but I do not know how long we can hold out against this onslaught. With each body we can buy you a chance to stop Shiro. I'm starting to think the stench down here is never going to leave my nostrils....</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Battle_in_the_Sewers&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div style=\"margin: 1em; border: solid silver; border-width: 1px 0px; padding: 2px 1em 2px 5em;\"><strong class=\"hiddenlinks\" style=\"position: absolute; margin-left: -4.8em; color: #900;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bug.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7d/Bug.png/18px-Bug.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7d/Bug.png/27px-Bug.png 1.5x, /images/7/7d/Bug.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Bug\" title=\"Bug\">Bug</a>.</strong>Two groups of <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Warrior\" title=\"Afflicted Warrior\">Afflicted Warriors</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted_Assassin\" title=\"Afflicted Assassin\">Assassins</a> (that <a href=\"/wiki/Spawn\" title=\"Spawn\">spawn</a> due to this quest) on the way to Commander Jafai won't move or <a href=\"/wiki/Attack\" title=\"Attack\">attack</a>, and use no <a href=\"/wiki/Skill\" title=\"Skill\">skills</a> except <a href=\"/wiki/Endure_Pain\" title=\"Endure Pain\">Endure Pain</a> (used by the Afflicted Warriors).</div>\n<div style=\"margin: 1em; border: solid silver; border-width: 1px 0px; padding: 2px 1em 2px 5em;\"><strong class=\"hiddenlinks\" style=\"position: absolute; margin-left: -4.8em; color: #900;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bug.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" src=\"/images/thumb/7/7d/Bug.png/18px-Bug.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7d/Bug.png/27px-Bug.png 1.5x, /images/7/7d/Bug.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Bug\" title=\"Bug\">Bug</a>.</strong>Sometimes the allied <a href=\"/wiki/Royal_Guard\" title=\"Royal Guard\">Royal Guards</a> won't spawn when you enter <a href=\"/wiki/Shenzun_Tunnels\" title=\"Shenzun Tunnels\">Shenzun Tunnels</a>. Rezoning seems to fix this.</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008174557\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 581/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5919/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2031/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.681      1 -total\n 29.95%    9.188      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 20.63%    6.330      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n  8.49%    2.606      2 Template:W\n  7.32%    2.245      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  6.78%    2.079      7 Template:Profession_icon_sizes\n  5.69%    1.747      3 Template:No\n  5.57%    1.709      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n  5.09%    1.563      4 Template:Yes